eco:AuthoredFoliageSpray rdf:type rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf eco:AuthoredPart ; rdfs:isDefinedBy eco:Ontology .
eco:AuthoredMaterial rdf:type rdfs:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf prov:Entity ; rdfs:isDefinedBy eco:Ontology .
