# Authored discrete surface-junction recipes. Source ports, sampling controls,
# and quality/resource bounds do not establish execution, analytic C1
# continuity, whole-body closure, or biological acceptance.
# The optional degree-elevated cubic interior control is in source-rest model
# displacement vector in metres. Its presence records authored method and
# controls only; it does not establish clearance or surface continuity.
